; ---- the parameter-id trie (lane mn10300-rest, 2026-10-31; the KN7000's ResourceIdTrie, the same design;
;      probes kn7000/notes/mn10300-rest-probes/kn6000_opaque.py / kn2400_opaque.py, group "trie") ----------
0x48404E70  ResourceIdTrie             ; the root of the parameter-id trie, 16 entries of {u32 target, u8 inner, u8 count, u16 0}: ResourceIdFind takes the 24-bit id's nibbles from bit 20 down; a leaf's +0 u32 is the id, +4 u16 its type (GetM3Em's records)
0x5014A95C  ResourceIdFind             ; (d0 = 24-bit id) walks ResourceIdTrie by the id's nibbles (lsr / and 0x0f / asl 3; `mov (a1), d1`, `movbu (4, a1)`, `movbu (5, a1)`) and answers the leaf whose +0 is the id, else 0
